# ExItS component priority (LOCKED)

When adding or changing UI, use the locked ExItS component for that job. Do not add a native control or a new component when an ExItS component already exists.

Search `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/components/exits/` and `/ui-standards` first.

| Job | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Text input | Locked global input (`exits-input-default.mdc`) |
| Single choice | `ExitsSelect` |
| Multiple choice | `ExitsMultiSelect` |
| Switch | `Switch` |
| Tabs | `ExitsTabs` |
| Table / responsive rows | `ExitsTable`, `ExitsResponsiveDataView` |
| Quantity | `QuantityStepper` with `variant="outline"` |
| Status | `StatusChip` |
| Confirm | `ConfirmActionDialog` |
| Create or edit | `FormDrawer` |
| Short dialog | `ExitsModal` (footer lock: `exits-modal-default.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass card | Quick Actions recipe (`exits-soft-glass-card.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass primary fields | Glass input, select, and search (`exits-soft-glass-primary-fields.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass date / date-time | Soft Glass Roll recipe (`exits-soft-glass-datetime.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass quick action | `SoftGlassQuickAction` (count badge \| chevron \| add) |
| Tooltip | `ExitsTooltip` (lock: `exits-tooltip-default.mdc`) |

A table filter is `ExitsMultiSelect`. Empty selection means all rows.
New Personal / Utang cards use Soft Glass (light + dark) — not flat Material cards.

Inputs and selects follow the global lock in `exits-input-default.mdc` and `exits-select-default.mdc`: intent, appearance, the 13px label, and the 14px text.
Icon-only actions use Soft Glass `ExitsTooltip` (`exits-tooltip-default.mdc`), not native `title` alone.

Detail: `.cursor/rules/exits-ui-architecture.mdc`.
